  m_text: 'Select: <voffset=0.02em><color=#B2B2B2><size=90%>Taskbar/Physics/Select
    Date</size></color></voffset></indent>


    Under <voffset=0.02em><color=#B2B2B2><size=90%>Search
    Avaliable Dates</size></color></voffset>, input your target month/year.</indent>

    The
    feild on the right will show you the closest data point availble to your given
    date.</indent>

    <indent=0.5em><voffset=0.02em><size=80%><b>Note:</b> the
    simulation can only step forwards in time so click the closest date that is before
    your target.</size></voffset></indent>



    If you want to jump to the exact
    date click <voffset=0.02em><color=#B2B2B2><size=90%>Exact Date?</size></color></voffset>
    and fill out the rest of the feilds</indent>

    <indent=0.5em><voffset=0.02em><size=80%>This
    will require the simulation to step to your time so on slower deivices This can
    take a while.</size></voffset>'
