      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<indent=1em>Sim speed: <color=#16FF7A>High</color>\nAccuracy: <color=#F6CD71>Medium</color>\n</indent>\n<color=#D7D7D7>Included
    Bodies</color>\n\u2022<indent=1em>Sun</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>Planet Barycenters</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>Moon
    <size=80%>(Earth)</size></indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>Ceres</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>Pallas</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>Vesta</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>Hygiea</indent>\n\n\nUse
    this to maximise the speed of the simulation (~1 month per second). Best for
    planning missions."
