      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<indent=0.6em>Select: <voffset=0.02em><color=#B2B2B2><size=90%>Taskbar/File/Export
    Planet Data</size></color></voffset> or \n<color=#11111100>Select:</color> <voffset=0.02em><color=#B2B2B2><size=90%>Taskbar/File/Export
    Mission Data</size></color></voffset></indent></indent>\n\n<size=120%>Exporting
    Planet Data</size>\n<indent=0.6em>Select what data you want to be exported under
    the <voffset=0.02em><color=#B2B2B2><size=90%>Included data</size></color></voffset>
    list.\n\nThe feild on the right will allow you to select induvidial planets/moons(or
    more) if needed.\n\n\nHowever, you can quickly select to export planets/moons\n\nYou
    can export either a <voffset=0.02em><color=#B2B2B2><size=90%>JSON</size></color></voffset>
    or <voffset=0.02em><color=#B2B2B2><size=90%>CSV</size></color></voffset>, using
    the feild at the bottom.\n</indent>\n\n<size=120%>Exporting Mission Data</size>\n<indent=0.6em>This
    has not been figured out yet</indent>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
